WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.333
Frontend and backend. Developers use these words constantly.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Most people think: frontend = pretty, backend = complicated.

3
00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:19.333
That's not accurate. Both are complex. Both are essential.

4
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:24.333
Frontend = everything you see and touch on screen.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Backend = servers, databases, logic — everything behind the scenes.

6
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:46.000
Instagram's feed you scroll is frontend.

7
00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:51.500
The database storing every photo, the algorithm — all backend.

8
00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:59.667
Full Stack developers build both sides — most versatile in tech.

9
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.667
Learn full stack development at 0xverse Academy.

